<title>SWEDEN: Swedish consumer prices fell 0.3 pct in Nov.</title>
<headline>Swedish consumer prices fell 0.3 pct in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish consumer prices fell by 0.3 percent in November, Statistics Sweden said on Thursday.  </p>
<p> SWEDISH CONSUMER PRICES     Nov 96     Oct 96	Nov 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	  -0.3	   0.0	  0.0</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	    -0.3	  -0.1	 +2.7</p>
<p>Note - Economists polled by Reuters had expected consumer prices to fall by 0.1 percent in November.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
